{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-11-18 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"張佳添與樂易玲傳緋聞後罕同框  添Sir曾被傳力追樂小姐  聚會氣氛曝光大方同坐\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7fd48d02be6d95a2c8ef71327bde728c/2026-11/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_127.png\"/>\n<p>著名音樂監製張佳添去年與黃宗澤舊愛甄采浠（前名甄詠珊）傳秘密拍拖，卻在疑似地下情曝光前，又有傳力追TVB高層「樂小姐」樂易玲，不過當時已遭二人否認，樂易玲更劃清界線表示：「唔關我事，我哋大家係同事嚟。」而近日張佳添與樂易玲罕有同框，證明二人的友好關係未有改變。</p>\n<h2>張佳添樂易玲共聚一齊坐</h2>\n<p>曾被譽為「香港鐘錶界女王」的商界女神胡曦文男友羅御軒，日前在IG分享四人聚會合照，相中張佳添與樂易玲坐在一起，氣氛融洽。照片中，四人品嚐精緻的法式料理，又舉杯暢飲，相談甚歡，隨後又在街頭自拍合照，足見友情深厚。</p>\n<img alt=\"張佳添曾與樂易玲傳緋聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c037de96b1e909f3d63d1efb9678d8c0/2025-07/cha_siuyan_1752596312_3677366859515978836_3599504669.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添（右）曾經澄清與樂易玲（右二）只是好友，更封對方是「TVB女神」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f3552bddd5d7cf799893a477a638262/2025-08/claytonmusic88_449437211_18448853575041611_6401076176801105797_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲直言張佳添的戀情與她無關：「唔關我事，我唔知道，我哋大家係同事嚟。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22e9a7d4e4c46e06d9c6d7945b325643/2024-01/6207.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲近日請食飯為胡曦文男友羅御軒慶祝生日，張佳添亦為坐上客。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5abd26866b0fb7f432c829f65c622d6a/2026-11/LOK_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲與張佳添未有因為曾傳緋聞而避忌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c52160129f21378176c9ff97a8e64f9/2026-11/LOK_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡曦文與男友羅御軒跟樂易玲、張佳添在街頭合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/947ef6d4ed1588a8783c27cad5668a94/2026-11/LOK_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"著名音樂製作人張佳添是《中年好聲音》評審之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ccf0af89c3db9035cb14d12b0bc1ffe1/2025-08/WhatsApp_Image_2025-08-10_at_5_19_55_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"著名音樂人張佳添近年在不少音樂比賽上擔任評判。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0c3d6febec163746014041cb7b1121c/2024-02/claytonmusic88_1699198519_3229433704203941636_292969610.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添由《中年好聲音》開始擔任評審。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2db92f4be6d21dd57748195be9763311/2025-01/473703414_18486785803041611_899433001955216397_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《中年好聲音2》在今年TVB台慶奪得「最佳綜藝節目」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/720c9de2f4344a410b557722835558c9/2025-01/472103559_18487815181041611_5153714395971507862_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《中年好聲音2》在今年TVB台慶奪得「最佳綜藝節目」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2952b4d59352b841a0487e69f79a864/2025-01/474218201_18487815211041611_2774144804891027236_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添三代同堂。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6e726ea5df61f055c29442c5864158b/2024-02/112_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添第一任太太黃敬佩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df75c9b6908401f5d9a787ea9bfb239b/2024-02/114_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添前妻黃敬佩是音樂人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b4baf601ed14ab1fa6d3a2fb8d5ff0ff/2024-02/115_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添與女兒關係很好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0276a92b7c922c785cdc850510ab066/2024-02/116_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添與前妻黃敬佩的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/057e8548a283fcc0d0a9954ebd5ab962/2024-02/424586764_10163203891404992_6841284466848129465_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳的女兒已經18歲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cfd24d1b6083bd93606baa7375a2d94a/2024-02/425713214_10163203888259992_395158010630493105_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添在社交平台貼上與大女的童年相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98df8f5b3c0189448b57de4ef3dc71de/2024-02/426061413_18418554157041611_315575809946086327_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添曾分享細女的相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5953a0603cc96e942d6fcd054f33df05/2025-01/claytonmusic88_1737551200_3551159312946974692_292969610.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添曾列出三大條件，表示揀女友要求高。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bf57e72098e94486defd4071be094c1f/2024-02/426179643_18419650414041611_1441372637375856777_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添變身兩性專家，日前拍片教40歲以上女性擇偶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9542fb7e70535fc3c44cb3cac4c86ec0/2025-07/771_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添認為中女擇偶要目標為本，知道自己真正需要，並要對男性採取精英淘汰制。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/593e7a52d6bb71dbce4d42d4b3264d45/2025-07/772.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添認為中女若有本事揀到3個目標，不必勉強選一個：點解唔可以搵佢哋去娛樂你一個？\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/179e9245952dd0644d4e5ca3af424f43/2025-07/773.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添回應與樂易玲的緋聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9da16d67d93af7fc6ab9906cb282f573/2025-08/WhatsApp_Image_2025-08-10_at_5_20_04_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添穿上的外套，被爆甄采浠都著過。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7d59ed8a67237db596948f1b9c782c19/2025-08/WhatsApp_Image_2025-08-10_at_5_20_03_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甄采浠的外套與張佳添的一樣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bca2c19491099e20c01b942baa1ac387/2025-08/clayton_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甄采浠曾在IG出PO。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e43a600c14d60c3cee1976b126f1afcf/2025-08/clayton_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添晒出甄采浠同一款相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cec42f86161abc434e21b0368a0649f6/2025-08/clayton_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"甄采浠拍片見到Tag張佳添。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00e423335c6391de9fd572af556932f5/2025-08/Carisa_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添的歌曲《你的幽靈》MV，由甄采浠負責監製。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a3a7f2a23c550fc8e8725ff549cd2a4/2025-08/clayton_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添於今年3月推出歌曲《你的幽靈》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe1f665e46135dded18cfc0c88156c39/2025-08/clayton_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添與甄采浠MV合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/144dffa06243687677b8f8a0990aacba/2025-08/Carisa_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添傳出戀甄采浠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b8ef4721e296108cbde1b6d009718ad/2025-08/Carisa_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"人稱「添Sir」的著名音樂人張佳添，初出道時是前樂隊Black Box主音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae276fdc7efcddee98f003bff834fb2c/2024-02/VS--YouTube---0_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添開YouTube頻道教人唱歌技巧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ce48869182e92904723e7039a355b6a/2024-02/VS--YouTube-mic-9_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添創辦宇宙大爆炸音樂有限公司。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b01a847c328fee972da6d36da67ab41/2024-02/DSC00126_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"著名音樂人張佳添其後轉戰幕後。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e743d0369757542a45366132af9208c6/2024-02/113_0.jpg\"/>\n<h2>張佳添樂易玲合照笑容滿面</h2>\n<p>當晚樂易玲身穿黑色西裝外套，內搭簡潔白衫，下身配搭白色長褲，盡顯優雅知性的女強人風範。而身旁的張佳添，則以休閒的裝束現身，身穿深藍色外套，內裡搭配灰色針織連帽衫，二人站在一起合照時笑容滿面，顯得十分大方自然。</p>\n<h2>樂易玲宴客為羅御軒慶祝生日</h2>\n<p>據羅御軒透露，當晚的飯敍為樂易玲精心準備的生日款待，與摯友一同品嚐精緻的法式菜，大讚佳餚美味，加上眾人愉快的聚會，留下美好的回憶，共同度過動人的時刻。</p>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲生日前夕舉行生日派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67def634f6dea36a7d17b2b09295a555/2026-06/029_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲在67歲生日前夕舉行派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5221c46d57beb269292efcce7e0a5bfb/2026-06/008_1_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張佳添和海兒出席樂易玲生日會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3288d1cac812148506450dc3479598a/2026-06/B19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲生日會場面熱鬧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ba02ebf4249a36d1bfce2732455bee0/2026-06/b41.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲不時分享三母子合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/398c63396c1d16facfd9f5c085964d45/2024-12/LOK_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲（中）1993年與陳君毅結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/781ef099def92c8cec91e5665ba53e51/2023-01/sdm04p05130604.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲為前夫陳君毅誕下兩子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaffa49110a7f3624323aa6b6303fbb4/2023-06/FotoJet10%20%283%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲婚後誕下兩子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f8ed834817d6af623c6d094e4431cc75/2023-06/KakaoTalk_20230612_115316399_13_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲與陳君毅於2018年突然傳出離婚。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/861bd8f295d8a9981eea5aa994a44eb2/2023-06/FotoJet12%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲與陳君毅（右）育有兩子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aaf59f4aff01c00c5414e13994c5e43d/2023-01/img_7836.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲的建築師前夫陳君毅2023年5月驚傳逝世。​ \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b331498877562070d04c02ed7d428914/2023-01/img_0345.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲育有兩名兒子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a078c7f70655680af1f6711013a5528/2022-12/6204.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲離婚，無損兒子與爸爸的感情。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14970d0467b175bc17899f35d60b4fc8/2024-01/620_ig_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲每到佳節都會貼出與兒子Adrian和Ryan合照。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/317d65b9746ac84723dba092cd077a1c/2024-01/620_ig_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲一對寶貝兒子充滿藝術天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6af9bdd014e3274284781eb8c32c2098/2023-01/620_ig_16.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲兩個囝囝都熱愛藝術，細仔Ryan不時參加不同藝術展覽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4dd7c5d0f2590ea0495c17a2420e3535/2023-01/ryan_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲兩個囝囝都熱愛藝術，細仔Ryan不時參加不同藝術展覽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8410b4315c62425d8a784d7e9c21370/2023-01/ryan_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"媽媽樂易玲當然都有現身支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/244253d176847ea7757eafd3f17f4c41/2023-01/ryan_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ryan畫風多變。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/691c2443e56c358bccc5af5e6a8cb7d4/2023-01/ryan_18.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲大仔（左）Adrian亦熱愛藝術。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d22322ecb64f0e7f1f085d36b28127e/2023-01/ryan_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《東周刊》早前獨家爆去年樂易玲生日收到Labubu花束，卻被一名男星偷竊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57dda576298f7f1d831f1b0c3bef5b20/2026-07/B.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"據悉，該名男星被指在派對上偷走周吉佩贈樂易玲的Labubu花束，事後被CCTV鎖定。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/baf0f43c3ad48a007bc9d81afa3b9028/2026-07/178333514655454_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"對於今次失竊事件，樂易玲表示其實是一個笑話。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bc53ae754e5180b27e2d49db136c687f/2026-07/001_0_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲說：「根本你哋唔講我都唔記得咗。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/06fd2984432194493f35cf73709bad2b/2026-07/002_0_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"樂易玲說：「嗰位藝人第二朝早已經打畀我。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5bd48de9893631c59c9c76892a8bcd28/2026-07/003_7.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T08:23:58.614103+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":482,"images":63,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T08:57:24.987282+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T08:17:28.925637+00:00","content_hash":"edb73fb33eb45e409a85a5c5c3df7105ed29681f0ffa1babfbc629093ea4dd22","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}